00000100 5345 4741 204D 4547 4120+  Console:	dc.b "SEGA MEGA DRIVE " ; Hardware system ID (Console name)
00000110 2843 2953 4547 4120 3139+  Date:		dc.b "(C)SEGA 1990.JUN" ; Copyright holder and release date (generally year)
