000001B8 2020 2020                  		dc.l $20202020		; SRAM end ($20xxxx)
000001BC 536F 6E69 6320 7468 6520+  Notes:		dc.b "Sonic the Hedgehog Tokyo Toy Show Remake V0.06      " ; Notes (unused, anything can be put in this space, but it has to be 52 bytes.)
